*   Role: Education Expert.
    *   Topic: Transition lesson for Literature (Ngữ văn - VAN), Grade 8, Week 1.
    *   Goal: Summarize core theory and exercises for Week 1, Grade 8, following the 2018 General Education Program (GDPT 2018) standards.
    *   Constraint 1: Do NOT copy the textbook directly.
